note Rebuilds every edge in the index from scratch: edges works out the list and connect writes it into the symbols. build runs it once after the walk, the CLI once after the servers a command asked have answered, and the GUI on a thread over a text-free copy (Index::symbols_only). Its cost is call sites times same-named candidates, which is what makes a repo full of 'new' slow to link.

