note Two lookup tables built once per link: every symbol by name, for resolve's candidates, and every file by path, so a server target finds its file without a scan. Then each symbol's tree-sitter calls go through resolve and each server target through symbol_at. The edge list is sorted and deduplicated, so a callee called twice is one edge.

